{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the whimsical world of <i>Yarn Guardians</i> with this lovingly composed 31-track original soundtrack, featuring over <strong>49 minutes</strong> of cozy melodies, epic boss themes, and hand-crafted ambient soundscapes.\u00a0Composed by Void Omen. Format: MP3, 320 kbps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the warmth of <i>Emma\u2019s House</i> to the tension of <i>Goliath</i>, from carnival chaos in <i>Eten Fair</i> to mystery in the <i>Clocktower</i>, each track captures the heart and humor of Rudy\u2019s journey through floating islands, ancient pyramids, and magical cat kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're reliving your favorite moments or just looking for the perfect cozy background music, this soundtrack brings the charm and spirit of <i>Yarn Guardians</i> straight to your ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856710?t=1755688798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856710?t=1755688798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856710/3d07e24123b229f04d2fd53a158dfed38f96d85f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755688798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856710/3d07e24123b229f04d2fd53a158dfed38f96d85f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755688798","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the whimsical world of <i>Yarn Guardians</i> with this lovingly composed 31-track original soundtrack, featuring over <strong>49 minutes</strong> of cozy melodies, epic boss themes, and hand-crafted ambient soundscapes.\u00a0Composed by Void Omen. Format: MP3, 320 kbps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the warmth of <i>Emma\u2019s House</i> to the tension of <i>Goliath</i>, from carnival chaos in <i>Eten Fair</i> to mystery in the <i>Clocktower</i>, each track captures the heart and humor of Rudy\u2019s journey through floating islands, ancient pyramids, and magical cat kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're reliving your favorite moments or just looking for the perfect cozy background music, this soundtrack brings the charm and spirit of <i>Yarn Guardians</i> straight to your ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["pentapaw studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2928940","name":"Yarn Guardians"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856710/509141808afb248507960f161fc9d2bf2b750dd2/header.jpg?t=1755688798","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Bold Head Interactive and Pentapaw Studios. Yarn Guardians, the Yarn Guardians logo, the Bold Head Interactive logo and the Pentapaw Studios logo are trademarks of brand and heist GmbH and/or Pentapaw Studios UG (haftungsbeschr\u00e4nkt). All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Yarn Guardians Official Soundtrack","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Yarn Guardians Soundtrack - $1.99 USD","packageid":1355917,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Yarn Guardians Official Soundtrack"}],"packages":[1355917],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 108 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Storage (high-quality audio):</strong> Additional 717 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":199,"final_formatted":"$1.99 USD","initial":199,"i